---
description: Project workflow rules for dashboard-operasional
alwaysApply: true
---

Before reading or changing project code, read `AGENTS.md` and `sebelum memulai project atau mengubah code agent suruh baca ini dahulu.md` completely. Follow their repository exploration, code review, test, and reporting requirements.

Work tolerantly with incomplete briefs, legacy data, and user corrections. Continue safe independent work using clearly stated assumptions. Ask only when the answer changes product behavior or an irreversible decision. Do not repeat answered questions, force unrelated refactors, or overwrite existing user changes.

Append every code handoff chronologically at the top of `reports/HANDOFF.md`. Include the date, behavior changed, main files, decisions, checks/tests actually run and their results, and remaining limitations. Never claim a test passed unless it ran.
